### REST Client (VS Code). Ubah baseUrl / kunci sesuai kebutuhan.
@baseUrl = https://lingogo.stei.site/api
# uji lokal: @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@apiKey = ISI_API_KEY
@email = demo@lingogo.stei.site
@password = ISI_PASSWORD_DEMO

### 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login -> salin token ke variabel di bawah
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Preferensi pengguna (bahasa UI, gaya pelafalan, bahasa daerah & kota terakhir)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ui_language": "id", "pron_style": "id", "target_language": "jv_ID", "default_city": "3578" }

### 4. Daftar provinsi + bahasa daerahnya (X-API-Key, untuk kelompok lain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/provinces?ui=id
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Cari kota (hasil: Surabaya -> bahasa Jawa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities?q=surabaya&ui=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5b. Kota tidak ada -> 404 {"detail":"Maaf, kota yang Anda cari tidak ada di database."}
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities?q=atlantis&ui=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5c. Hanya kota / hanya kabupaten
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities?q=Kab. Malang&ui=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Alur utama: kota -> kategori + kartu frasa (arti & pelafalan Indonesia)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities/3578/phrasebook?ui=id&pron=id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6b. Kota berbahasa ganda: pilih bahasa lain
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities/3274/phrasebook?lang=su_ID&ui=en&pron=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Satu frasa: arti Inggris, pelafalan Inggris
GET {{baseUrl}}/phrases/shop_how_much?lang=ban_ID&ui=en
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 8. Nomor darurat nasional
GET {{baseUrl}}/emergency-numbers?ui=id
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
